      "message": "Yes, the logic here to check if it\u0027s asserted(physical level 0, then go to S5 sleep).\nI copied some of the log sent in email here, the vw data does get read as 1 and inverted as 0 for logical value. so we have those de-asserted and can continue booting up.\nvw_get_level(ESPI_VWIRE_SIGNAL_SLP_S4) 1\npower_signal_get(PWR_SLP_S4) 0\n\nvw_get_level(ESPI_VWIRE_SIGNAL_SLP_S5) 1\npower_signal_get(PWR_SLP_S5) 0\nBTW, the LOG_DBG is not working in vw file. I also use shell command to call the function there and couldn\u0027t get print either.",
